From 4326c1b9e9fbb6f7fa943b89dcfe2ab0b942840e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 07:02:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): clear the claim hold when the sync watcher gives
 up

A crashed sync loop left loop_expected set, so the dispatcher deferred every claim with sync_first_round and a portable card stayed eligible only for that machine.

When supervision will not restart the watcher, clear that hold. Publish metrics.claiming=0 while the gate is closed, and drop that machine from portable eligibility. A machine pin stays.
